  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assisted Voluntary Return for EU Stranded Migrants in Luxembourg</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to continue supporting the Luxembourgish government in facilitating safe and dignified returns of European stranded migrants and third country nationals having a residence permit in an EU country (or a country that is associated to the Schengen area) to their country of origin or of habitual residence. IOM will provide neutral, comprehensive and updated information during counselling sessions on the AVR process, vulnerability assessment, updates on country of origin/return socio and economic situation, travel assistance, medical support when needed, and post-arrival assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
